      "prefix": "of his, ",
      "suffix": " Galeus "
    },
    "source": "Project Gutenberg #10800",
    "text": "Galeus de rubeis, civis noster faber ferrarius, ob inventionem instrumenti Cocleae olim Archimedis dicti, prae laetitia insanivit."
  },
  "1.2.3.14-r14": {
